      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{65fa77b9ab14b46952dc1993|full_name} Would be nice if there was a way for avatar developers/modders to just export the character as some binary file that could then be sent to the consumer, who then just uploads it to their account via the web site.  Saves them the effort of trying to set up CC and Unity and trying to figure out how to upload a character from there.",
